WEBVTT

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:18.477
Important cultural assets inspection?

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:21.021
What is this?

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.606
No talking back!

00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:25.525
If you do not execute your mission
by the deadline,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.985
I'll set it off.

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:28.362
What?!

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:33.200
There's no way there would be a real
mission in a scenic place like that.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.953
If you wanted to invite me on a trip,
just say so.

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:37.287
This isn't a vacation!

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:40.249
This is very serious, Izana!

00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:42.334
I want you to take this mission with me!

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:46.880
<i>Tanikaze just asked Izana
<i>to go on an overnight trip with him?</i></i>

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:49.466
<i>And on top of that, to Senshukyou!</i>

00:00:58.809 --> 00:00:59.977
Wow.

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:04.147
So this is Senshukyou.

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:06.191
Over here, Nagate!

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:09.528
Look, it's even prettier
when you see it up close!

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.118
Nagate?

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:17.828
Yeah.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.211
Izana.

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.797
Nagate.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:35.554
<i>Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light!</i></i>

00:01:39.558 --> 00:01:44.855
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:51.612
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:55.782
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:02:02.664 --> 00:02:05.709
<i>Our only haven is this fortress</i>

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:08.795
<i>Wandering among the stars</i>

00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:12.049
<i>Where we tremble with impatience</i>

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:14.468
<i>Between life and death</i>

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:20.223
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:25.062
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:27.272 --> 00:02:33.195
<i>Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here</i></i>

00:02:33.945 --> 00:02:39.910
<i>Carry within ourselves the will to fight</i>

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:43.538
<i>Our lives shine their brightest</i>

00:02:43.622 --> 00:02:46.041
<i>In the defense of love</i>

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:50.003
<i>We boldly enter the fray</i>

00:02:50.087 --> 00:02:54.508
<i>The Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:04.476
MISSION

00:03:09.481 --> 00:03:13.443
<i>Attention reconstruction teams, this is
<i>a message from the inspection commander.</i></i>

00:03:13.527 --> 00:03:17.781
<i>Please use the construction material
<i>stored in the supply depot.</i></i>

00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:20.909
We've sure made a lot of progress.

00:03:23.161 --> 00:03:25.747
Tsumugi, are you by yourself today?

00:03:25.997 --> 00:03:27.416
Where is your boyfriend?

00:03:29.126 --> 00:03:30.961
Well, if you are ever lonely,

00:03:31.086 --> 00:03:33.338
I'd be happy to form up with you anytime.

00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:34.631
Tsuruuchi.

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:37.551
You are such a pig.

00:03:38.176 --> 00:03:41.638
Tsumugi, stay away from him, okay?

00:03:45.809 --> 00:03:46.643
Oh?

00:03:47.102 --> 00:03:48.729
Would you like to form up with me?

00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:56.027
Only if you promise to be gentle.

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.613
Hold on tight.

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:01.283
Okay!

00:04:42.199 --> 00:04:44.034
It was a good formation!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.830
Are you okay?

00:04:49.372 --> 00:04:51.374
Tsuruuchi!

00:05:03.512 --> 00:05:05.013
Nagate...

00:05:07.599 --> 00:05:09.017
What about the inspection?

00:05:09.476 --> 00:05:11.228
Oh, right.

00:05:12.729 --> 00:05:13.772
Okay.

00:05:14.773 --> 00:05:18.151
This is the best cherry blossom spot
in Sidonia.

00:05:18.485 --> 00:05:19.903
Really?

00:05:21.571 --> 00:05:23.615
There's no issue with the banister.

00:05:24.199 --> 00:05:25.951
The flowers are pretty.

00:05:27.619 --> 00:05:29.454
Next, we go over there.

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:33.124
Stop pretending
that you're doing an inspection.

00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:35.168
There is no issue with the flooring!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.505
Seriously...

00:05:43.134 --> 00:05:44.886
-Hello?
<i>-Tsumugi,</i>

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:47.597
<i>I found a way to sneak into Senshukyou.</i>

00:05:47.931 --> 00:05:49.015
I sent you a map.

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:51.142
I also wrote what I want you to do.

00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:55.188
We can't let them be alone
in a place like that!

00:05:55.647 --> 00:05:58.441
-Okay!
-Tsumugi, what are you doing?

00:05:58.608 --> 00:06:01.027
You have a routine
maintenance inspection today.

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:02.529
Ah, yes!

00:06:14.541 --> 00:06:16.501
No issue with the bedding.

00:06:17.627 --> 00:06:20.338
Why are you inspecting that?

00:06:20.505 --> 00:06:23.091
I should check the security door next.

00:06:27.345 --> 00:06:30.140
Let me check here.

00:06:33.059 --> 00:06:34.477
W-what happened?

00:06:45.322 --> 00:06:46.281
Excuse me.

00:06:46.448 --> 00:06:47.866
How much longer will it take?

00:06:48.116 --> 00:06:50.285
It won't end unless you sit still.

00:07:00.045 --> 00:07:03.256
What is taking so long? Where is she?

00:07:11.556 --> 00:07:12.432
Is this it?

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:33.828
I could keep looking at this forever.

00:07:34.621 --> 00:07:35.622
Shoot!

00:07:35.789 --> 00:07:37.499
I have to do the inspection.

00:07:42.963 --> 00:07:45.924
Security doors are operational.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.344
What's next on the list?

00:07:50.178 --> 00:07:54.057
"Stand by in Senshukyou
until ten-hundred tomorrow."

00:07:55.058 --> 00:07:56.893
So, I guess we are staying here tonight.

00:07:59.104 --> 00:08:00.271
That's it?

00:08:02.732 --> 00:08:03.858
What shall we do?

00:08:04.067 --> 00:08:05.235
What?

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:09.072
Are you asking me?

00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:11.950
Am I supposed to know the answer?

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:20.125
The water in this pond
isn't floating away in zero gravity!

00:08:20.709 --> 00:08:23.503
-It's not a pond.
-What?

00:08:25.005 --> 00:08:26.548
You're right. It's warm!

00:08:26.631 --> 00:08:29.134
This is called a zero gravity bath.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:31.219
It's my first time seeing one, too.

00:08:31.302 --> 00:08:33.138
It's really luxurious.

00:08:33.304 --> 00:08:34.848
Really?

00:08:35.223 --> 00:08:36.307
Let's try to go in!

00:08:36.474 --> 00:08:38.059
What?

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:44.941
I meant...

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:49.237
I'd love to bring Tsumugi here sometime.
She would enjoy it.

00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:57.370
The stars are pretty, aren't they?

00:09:02.042 --> 00:09:03.334
Nagate.

00:09:05.295 --> 00:09:06.546
Let's...

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:08.923
take the bath together.

00:09:09.174 --> 00:09:10.050
What?

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:21.436
TOP SECRET MISSION:
INSPECT IMPORTANT CULTURAL ASSETS

00:09:21.561 --> 00:09:23.772
This is my Grandma's writing.

00:09:26.983 --> 00:09:28.902
What is this?

00:09:30.028 --> 00:09:31.988
This was all her doing?

00:09:32.947 --> 00:09:34.157
No, let me explain!

00:09:34.365 --> 00:09:35.825
I can't believe this.

00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:37.202
Izana!

00:09:37.535 --> 00:09:38.661
Wait!

00:09:38.828 --> 00:09:39.996
Leave me alone!

00:09:41.873 --> 00:09:43.416
Let go of me!

00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:53.259
Watch out, be careful!

00:09:53.676 --> 00:09:56.346
Wait! Just listen to me!

00:09:57.931 --> 00:10:00.558
Nagate, you don't care about me at all!

00:10:01.726 --> 00:10:03.061
I...

00:10:14.572 --> 00:10:20.411
SITES OF SIDONIA
OUTER WALL RESIDENCE ROOF

00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:30.421
You're still up?

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:32.423
Yes.

00:10:32.966 --> 00:10:36.344
You know, just because
they are spending a night together,

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:39.305
that doesn't mean anything's gonna happen.

00:10:39.472 --> 00:10:41.516
And I mean, they were

00:10:41.683 --> 00:10:44.978
living together
before we moved in with them.

00:10:45.353 --> 00:10:49.899
But Izana wasn't a woman then!

00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:54.237
You were the one
who wanted to call this off!

00:10:54.571 --> 00:10:56.531
Now, stop thinking about it and go to bed!

00:10:56.656 --> 00:11:00.118
You are the one who can't sleep
because you're thinking about it!

00:11:03.288 --> 00:11:04.873
Yuhata...

00:11:05.832 --> 00:11:08.751
If I were human,

00:11:09.169 --> 00:11:12.547
do you think he would've asked me
on a trip like that?

00:11:13.089 --> 00:11:14.173
Tsumugi...

00:11:15.174 --> 00:11:20.346
To tell the truth,
I overheard their conversation.

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:24.017
Nagate, you don't care about me at all!

00:11:25.143 --> 00:11:26.019
I...

00:11:26.269 --> 00:11:27.186
You did?

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:30.064
And what did Tanikaze say?

00:11:38.448 --> 00:11:43.244
But eavesdropping is bad, isn't it?

00:11:43.536 --> 00:11:47.332
I'm sorry.
Please forget I even mentioned it.

00:11:51.002 --> 00:11:52.962
Really?

00:12:24.661 --> 00:12:25.870
Well...

00:12:26.204 --> 00:12:27.664
Okay...

00:12:28.831 --> 00:12:30.166
<i>Early this morning,</i>

00:12:30.249 --> 00:12:32.502
<i>Sidonia entered the Lem Star System.</i>

00:12:33.211 --> 00:12:37.006
<i>Subsequently, the military forces
<i>are taking extra security precautions,</i></i>

00:12:37.298 --> 00:12:40.718
<i>as well as announcing
<i>an increase in rationing.</i></i>

00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:44.555
It has finally come to this.

00:12:45.682 --> 00:12:51.938
Kobayashi, is this really the direction
Sidonia should be heading in?

00:12:57.235 --> 00:12:58.987
What about Seven's settlers?

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:02.532
We still haven't reestablished contact.
I'm afraid that...

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:04.617
I see.

00:13:05.535 --> 00:13:09.998
We must do everything possible
to obtain Nine.

00:13:13.501 --> 00:13:17.296
Holding this planet will be key
in this war.

00:13:18.006 --> 00:13:19.007
Yes.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.884
This planet is an important location
that would serve

00:13:21.968 --> 00:13:26.014
as a natural fortress in our battle
with the gauna cluster.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:30.143
Just buy me some time...

00:13:30.685 --> 00:13:32.020
Kobayashi.

00:13:39.152 --> 00:13:41.237
<i>Special Work Team 3,
<i>continue tuning and connection</i></i>

00:13:41.404 --> 00:13:44.532
<i>of the garde high-speed support armor
<i>main propulsion unit.</i></i>

00:13:44.741 --> 00:13:46.951
Whoa! Is it done?

00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:51.622
Yes. You'll be able to enter the
atmosphere even while you are separated.

00:13:51.914 --> 00:13:54.584
We are planning on doing a test flight
on this Hayakaze

00:13:54.709 --> 00:13:58.046
when we survey Planet Nine.

00:13:58.546 --> 00:14:01.966
So, you just want to throw our bodies
at the gauna in those coffins?

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:03.259
What?!

00:14:03.426 --> 00:14:07.013
You did us a favor by making the tip
out of man-made kabi.

00:14:07.346 --> 00:14:09.974
Basically, you want us expendable pilots
to get in this thing

00:14:10.058 --> 00:14:12.435
and crash into the gauna cluster, right?

00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:13.478
Hey, cut it out!

00:14:14.729 --> 00:14:15.813
Sorry about that.

00:14:15.938 --> 00:14:19.275
She is just nervous about
the upcoming reconnaissance mission.

00:14:21.611 --> 00:14:24.322
Well, I suppose if I were in charge,

00:14:24.447 --> 00:14:28.159
I wouldn't be sending
a valuable new toy

00:14:28.326 --> 00:14:32.038
or my best pilot
out on a lowly recon mission either!

00:14:32.205 --> 00:14:34.290
Enough! Let's go!

00:14:36.209 --> 00:14:38.211
Take care of Sidonia for me...

00:14:38.503 --> 00:14:39.837
Mr. Hero!

00:14:46.552 --> 00:14:47.929
Don't let her bother you.

00:14:48.388 --> 00:14:52.308
You can't let anybody see you conflicted.

00:14:52.642 --> 00:14:54.018
Yes, sir.

00:15:03.152 --> 00:15:04.987
What is this?

00:15:07.698 --> 00:15:09.742
It's called <i>natto.</i>

00:15:11.327 --> 00:15:12.412
Command Division?

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:15.748
Yes, this is Shinatose.

00:15:16.249 --> 00:15:17.083
Pardon?

00:15:19.585 --> 00:15:20.753
Yes.

00:15:22.088 --> 00:15:24.340
Yes. Understood.

00:15:27.635 --> 00:15:28.845
Izana?

00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:34.934
Someone was arrested for deserting
tomorrow's reconnaissance mission.

00:15:35.435 --> 00:15:37.937
And I guess I was the next in line.

00:15:43.693 --> 00:15:46.946
We're taking too long
switching to the type 2 equipment!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:50.324
It may be a reconnaissance mission,
but they're going to battle!

00:15:51.409 --> 00:15:52.660
Hurry up, over there!

00:15:52.827 --> 00:15:54.620
Make sure you don't damage it!

00:15:55.246 --> 00:15:57.874
Hurry up and drop
maintenance stations four and five!

00:15:58.082 --> 00:15:59.625
They're in the way!

00:15:59.917 --> 00:16:04.046
Don't forget to do the final inspection
of the inertia control unit!

00:16:04.255 --> 00:16:06.632
<i>Units have been outfitted
<i>in their type 2 equipment.</i></i>

00:16:06.716 --> 00:16:09.760
<i>Pilots, board your units after
<i>they have been cleared for deployment.</i></i>

00:16:10.136 --> 00:16:12.513
Reconnaissance Team,
after linking with the Hayakaze,

00:16:12.597 --> 00:16:14.348
advance to Planet Nine and proceed.

00:16:14.432 --> 00:16:17.351
Concentrate on the regions
unobservable from here.

00:16:17.518 --> 00:16:19.228
Once completed, return to Sidonia.

00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:20.438
<i>Copy that.</i>

00:16:20.521 --> 00:16:22.648
<i>Reconnaissance Team, ready for deployment!</i>

00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:24.192
Begin operation!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:27.278
<i>Planet Nine Reconnaissance Team
<i>has been deployed.</i></i>

00:16:27.487 --> 00:16:29.739
<i>Next stage, ready the Hayakaze for launch.</i>

00:16:29.822 --> 00:16:32.241
<i>Reconnaissance Team,
<i>proceed in clasp formation.</i></i>

00:16:33.075 --> 00:16:35.620
-Maintain our current formation.
-Copy that!

00:16:36.704 --> 00:16:40.333
<i>Prepare engine thruster blast doors!</i>

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.044
<i>Open all barriers
<i>in the central launch gate.</i></i>

00:16:43.169 --> 00:16:45.630
<i>Suspension device locked.
<i>Launch gate, course secured.</i></i>

00:16:46.672 --> 00:16:48.925
<i>High-speed support armor Hayakaze,</i>

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:50.468
<i>ready for deployment!</i>

00:16:50.718 --> 00:16:52.303
Launch the Hayakaze!

00:17:03.898 --> 00:17:05.024
<i>Hayakaze Reconnaissance Team...</i>

00:17:05.107 --> 00:17:07.109
Shinatose, you are too close
to the inside.

00:17:07.193 --> 00:17:08.277
Oh... Yes, sir!

00:17:08.402 --> 00:17:11.030
<i>Maintain clasp formation.
<i>Steady travel velocity.</i></i>

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.156
Get ready!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.408
<i>Hayakaze, decelerate
<i>to allowable linkage speeds.</i></i>

00:17:14.492 --> 00:17:16.452
<i>You are approaching the contact point.</i>

00:17:19.789 --> 00:17:21.958
Synchronizing course
to the Reconnaissance Team!

00:17:22.166 --> 00:17:23.459
Steady now.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.213
Relative velocity synchronized.
Hayakaze, expand armor!

00:17:32.385 --> 00:17:35.596
<i>Reconnaissance Team and Hayakaze
<i>are maintaining identical velocities!</i></i>

00:17:36.264 --> 00:17:37.348
<i>Standby for linkage!</i>

00:17:38.224 --> 00:17:40.726
<i>That's right, get close slowly.</i>

00:17:40.851 --> 00:17:44.355
<i>Reconnaissance Team, approach Hayakaze
<i>maintaining clasp formation.</i></i>

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:51.237
Unit linkage success!

00:17:51.862 --> 00:17:53.864
Linkage successful.

00:17:56.617 --> 00:17:58.369
<i>Set course for Planet Nine,</i>

00:17:58.536 --> 00:17:59.996
<i>maximum output!</i>

00:18:15.803 --> 00:18:18.139
Calm down, Tanikaze.

00:18:18.681 --> 00:18:20.349
Is this your first time on reserve?

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:21.892
Yes.

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:23.519
I know how you feel,

00:18:23.728 --> 00:18:26.188
but there is nothing you can do here.

00:18:26.772 --> 00:18:29.025
Why don't you go for a walk
and clear you head?

00:18:47.918 --> 00:18:49.211
Tsumugi...

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:50.755
Tanikaze!

00:18:51.213 --> 00:18:54.216
I can't stop worrying about Izana.

00:18:54.759 --> 00:18:56.177
Me, too.

00:18:56.302 --> 00:18:58.262
I wish I was with them.

00:19:13.444 --> 00:19:15.279
This is Recon to Command.

00:19:15.571 --> 00:19:17.907
We are about to enter
the dark side of Planet Nine.

00:19:18.115 --> 00:19:18.949
Copy that.

00:19:19.116 --> 00:19:20.910
Remember, the gauna is good at hiding.

00:19:21.035 --> 00:19:21.911
Be careful.

00:19:29.752 --> 00:19:33.464
We are passing by the planet's rings.
Still all clear.

00:19:34.006 --> 00:19:35.132
Shinatose,

00:19:35.257 --> 00:19:37.677
<i>are you picking up anything
<i>with your new radar?</i></i>

00:19:37.885 --> 00:19:40.346
No. All is clear.

00:19:41.931 --> 00:19:44.058
<i>They looked so beautiful at a distance,</i>

00:19:44.183 --> 00:19:46.477
<i>but once you get close,
<i>they are just dirty rocks.</i></i>

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:50.398
It looks like a gauna could jump out
of the shadows any minute.

00:19:50.481 --> 00:19:51.524
I feel uneasy.

00:19:52.858 --> 00:19:55.069
<i>Don't get distracted by the rings.</i>

00:19:55.986 --> 00:19:59.323
<i>We'll be entering the closest point
<i>to the planet on our vector soon.</i></i>

00:19:59.407 --> 00:20:00.658
CLOSEST POINT

00:20:12.128 --> 00:20:13.170
What was that?

00:20:13.295 --> 00:20:14.296
VISUAL CORTEX CONNECTION
INTERRUPTED

00:20:16.006 --> 00:20:17.842
-My eyes!
<i>-Shinatose, what's wrong?</i>

00:20:17.967 --> 00:20:18.801
<i>What did you see?</i>

00:20:18.926 --> 00:20:22.054
<i>Izana. Stay calm.
<i>Focus back on the radar.</i></i>

00:20:22.138 --> 00:20:23.180
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:36.068 --> 00:20:37.570
Am I seeing...?

00:20:37.987 --> 00:20:40.322
There is a haze in our flight course.

00:20:40.489 --> 00:20:42.575
<i>A haze? I don't see anything.</i>

00:20:44.201 --> 00:20:46.454
I'll try firing a shot
from the Heigus particle cannon.

00:20:47.329 --> 00:20:48.164
TARGET LOCKED

00:20:53.002 --> 00:20:54.003
Did it hit?

00:20:55.004 --> 00:20:57.465
ANALYZING TARGET
IMPACT POINT

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:59.341
RESPONSE DETECTED

00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:00.760
Something is there!

00:21:22.948 --> 00:21:24.450
What is that?

00:21:32.541 --> 00:21:34.001
<i>It's a cloaked gauna!</i>

00:21:34.585 --> 00:21:36.462
<i>Damn it, evasive maneuvers!</i>

00:21:36.587 --> 00:21:37.671
<i>It's too big!</i>

00:21:37.797 --> 00:21:39.173
<i>We can't evade it in time!</i>

00:21:39.298 --> 00:21:42.676
<i>We might be able to pierce through it
<i>if we maintain our course!</i></i>

00:21:42.843 --> 00:21:44.428
Recon Team, eject from Hayakaze.

00:21:44.553 --> 00:21:46.889
-You have to evade it!
<i>-Copy that.</i>

00:21:47.264 --> 00:21:49.391
-All units, eject!
-Copy that!

00:21:57.441 --> 00:21:59.360
MAN-MADE KABI LOST
PENETRATION FAILED

00:21:59.568 --> 00:22:02.571
It broke without piercing through.

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:04.657
That's no ordinary ena.

00:22:13.874 --> 00:22:17.503
No, the membrane is growing...

00:22:32.017 --> 00:22:33.269
Izana.

00:22:40.985 --> 00:22:42.444
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:50.828
<i>Oh, if this world must decay</i>

00:22:50.911 --> 00:22:54.582
<i>And I'm destined to give my life away</i>

00:22:54.665 --> 00:22:59.753
<i>What should I be living for?</i>

00:23:01.338 --> 00:23:05.676
<i>If I had never met you</i>

00:23:05.759 --> 00:23:09.346
<i>I would never have known</i>

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:15.352
<i>This pain that tears at my heart</i>

00:23:15.436 --> 00:23:17.771
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-Echoing there</i></i>

00:23:17.855 --> 00:23:19.857
<i>-Fortune
<i>-In the furthest reaches of the cosmos</i></i>

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:22.860
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Is this clumsy requiem</i></i>

00:23:22.943 --> 00:23:25.237
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-And yet</i></i>

00:23:25.321 --> 00:23:27.156
<i>-Fortune
<i>-I'm still searching</i></i>

00:23:27.239 --> 00:23:30.576
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Within this uncertain reality</i></i>

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.661
<i>For you</i>

00:23:32.745 --> 00:23:36.373
<i>The joy of our finding each other</i>

00:23:36.457 --> 00:23:40.085
<i>The vanished warmth</i>

00:23:40.169 --> 00:23:43.797
<i>You should know that I remember it all</i>

00:23:43.881 --> 00:23:47.551
<i>Because I loved you</i>

00:23:47.635 --> 00:23:51.221
<i>The emotions that arise</i>

00:23:51.305 --> 00:23:54.850
<i>The scars left in my heart</i>

00:23:54.933 --> 00:23:59.271
<i>You should know that I'll carry them all</i>

00:23:59.355 --> 00:24:05.944
<i>As I walk this path</i>
